// Puts the ribbon rib, the quick-access strip and the tabs in the band at (rbi_x, rbi_y) of size rbi_w by rbi_h: the quick-access strip along the top, the tab strip under it, the groups of the open tab in the body, a margin in from the sides; makes a widget for every control at the place it got and closes any open menu. Call it after every change of the window's size.
rib_fit(Ribbon rib, int rbi_x, int rbi_y, int rbi_w, int rbi_h) {
